    {
      "id": "2d589d3fd0b4cc579f3446a06d81a95cf810fb14",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1725467388,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It looks like the Documentation job failed, because the `ruby-dev` package was needed to build `asciidoctor-epub3` but wasn't installed along with the other Ruby packages. It must have worked before, so I suppose this is just an unfortunate change in the dependency change somewhere in Ubuntu. \n\n@geraldcombs, should some of these ruby dependencies be added to the ubuntu container directly, or to `debian-setup`?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-01-12T15:17:59.306Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-01-12T17:35:37.425Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 273686797,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 13929,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1725723155,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I'd like to keep the documentation dependencies local to the Documentation job for now, similar to what we do for the fuzzing and code lines jobs. I'll upload a MR that adds ruby-dev shortly.\n\nAfter installing ruby-dev here the EPUB3 builds still failed because we didn't have a UTF-8 locale set. I pushed a change to the ubuntu-dev Docker image which should fix that.",
